# Use JDK 21 For Project Commands

When running any project-related shell command in this repository, prefix it with:

```bash
JAVA_HOME="/Library/Java/JavaVirtualMachines/temurin-21.jdk/Contents/Home"
```

Examples:

```bash
JAVA_HOME="/Library/Java/JavaVirtualMachines/temurin-21.jdk/Contents/Home" ./mvnw test -Dsurefire.useFile=false
JAVA_HOME="/Library/Java/JavaVirtualMachines/temurin-21.jdk/Contents/Home" ./restart-backend.sh
JAVA_HOME="/Library/Java/JavaVirtualMachines/temurin-21.jdk/Contents/Home" npx vitest run
```

Do not use `JAVA_TOOL_OPTIONS="-Dnet.bytebuddy.experimental=true"` as a Java 25 workaround; run commands under JDK 21 instead.
